cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its teaching materials, please cite it as below."
title: "作业智评 / Homework AI Grading Lab: a teaching demo of photo-based homework assessment with OCR, rubric-based LLM grading and teacher review"
abstract: "A teaching demo of an education-assessment pipeline: a guardian photographs homework on a phone, the server corrects the image (OpenCV), recognises the handwriting, grades it against a YAML rubric with structured output, a teacher reviews and adjusts the scores (append-only audit trail), and student profiles and a class dashboard are updated. FastAPI + SQLite backend, vanilla-JS front end. All demo data are synthetic and grading in the demo is an offline rule-based mock, not a real model. Part of the AI Teaching Demos series."
type: software
